  "description": "Defensive preflight checks for .NET desktop applications on Windows. Validates file paths (UNC, extended paths, alternate data streams, reserved device names, reparse points), URLs (HTTPS only, domain allow/deny lists), external binaries (SHA-256 hash, Authenticode signature, certificate chain pinning), NTFS ACLs (overly broad write access), remote TLS certificates (explicit pinning and SAN validation) and the process execution location (network share, temporary folder, recycle bin, NTFS-compressed folder). Pure functions: every check returns a boolean, with an optional 'out string? reason' overload giving the exact rejection cause — no logging, no hidden side effects. Extracted from the Chaturbate Recorder project.",
